---
import BaseLayout from '../components/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use | TypeInsight"
  description="TypeInsight terms of use — the rules and limitations governing use of this website."
>
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 font-sans text-charcoal">
    <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl mb-8">Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="text-xs text-muted mb-10">Last updated: August 2025</p>

    <section class="space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl text-charcoal mb-3">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>By accessing or using TypeInsight, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Use. If you do not agree, please do not use this website.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl text-charcoal mb-3">2. Not Professional Advice</h2>
        <p>TypeInsight provides personality assessments and related content for educational and entertainment purposes only. Nothing on this website constitutes psychological, medical, legal, or financial advice. Results are not a substitute for consultation with a qualified professional.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl text-charcoal mb-3">3. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>All content on TypeInsight — including text, design, and code — is the property of TypeInsight and may not be reproduced without permission. The MBTI® acronym is a registered trademark of The Myers-Briggs Company. TypeInsight is not affiliated with or endorsed by The Myers-Briggs Company.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl text-charcoal mb-3">4. Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
        <p>TypeInsight participates in affiliate marketing programmes. We may earn commissions when you click links to third-party services. This never affects the price you pay. Sponsored content is clearly labelled.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl text-charcoal mb-3">5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>TypeInsight is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind. We are not liable for any damages arising from your use of, or inability to use, this website or its content.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl text-charcoal mb-3">6. Governing Law</h2>
        <p>These terms are governed by applicable law. Disputes shall be resolved in the courts of competent jurisdiction.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
